      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a decent start, but it's actually a bit too short for what I'm looking for. The automated system is going to give this a pretty low score because of the word count, and I really need a summary that is much more comprehensive so I don't miss any nuances from those 50 reviews.\n\nCould you expand on this significantly? I need you to go into much more detail for every single point you mentioned. For example, instead of just saying \"camera performance is inconsistent,\" explain exactly what users said about the night shots versus moving subjects, or the macro mode. Try to get the summary much longer so it actually provides a deep dive into the user experience. \n\nAgain, please don't just repeat yourself to make it longer—I need actual new details from the reviews—but I definitely need more substance and more words than what you just gave me.",
